{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_st01",
  "title": "拉馬克行動",
  "storyCode": "OD-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6198aa7a7ec07312f03f8ef49fe1da731fc0b55459189fd17d078e458a4c97a4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我們已進入磁山二號，重複一遍，我們已進入磁山二號。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Iana、Ela，你們那邊情況如何？完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "一切照舊，我們很快就能完成收尾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Ela？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "Iana，準備接敵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "text": "已就位！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "text": "複製器已開啟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "地雷部署！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "如果情報無誤，這就是最後一批了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "我們處理完畢後就向你們靠攏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "Gówno！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "text": "Ela通訊完畢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "情況就是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "放心交給波蘭人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我已經聽到雷電地雷觸發的聲音了，她們會沒事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "而你，Blitz，把注意力放回警戒上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "聽你的，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "注意儀錶讀數，情報顯示這個建築物裡有封存的核廢料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Frost，我們離目標還有多遠？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "穿過前面的檢查站和材料儲藏室，就是主實驗室。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "無人機顯示雇傭兵在檢查站及周邊建造了簡易工事 。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "沒有掩體，沒有死角，入口位置堵死，周邊佈設了大量鐵絲網。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "人數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "九人，大致位置已標記在了小隊的終端上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "檢查站進入儲藏室的長廊入口完全封死了，無人機無法進一步深入。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "彙報完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "還有其他入口嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "沒有看到入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "好，我會解決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "有什麼建議嗎，Lord？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "燃燒榴彈還有剩餘，你要用幾顆？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "兩發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "瞭解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "檢查站入口的阻塞太龐雜了，如果爆破，瓦礫會對突入造成很大影響。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我的計劃是炸開牆體上方和右側的牆面，一個人掛繩在上方提供火力壓制，剩餘人員從右側缺口突入。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Frost，壓制和支援交給你來辦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "收到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "貼片炸藥爆炸後，Tachanka，你從上方缺口拋射榴彈，其他人按照標識位置投擲閃光彈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "地面突入按照Blitz、Ash、Tachanka的順序來，行動要緊湊，不留可趁之機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "有問題就現在提出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "都確認了？那好，各自就位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Frost，等你的信號，然後我們開始行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "正在前往預定位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "貼片炸藥部署完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "炸藥部署完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "準備——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "閃光彈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "榴彈已射出！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "突入！突入！突入！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "敵人倒下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Blitz，兩點鐘方向！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "已投擲手榴彈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "十點鐘，機槍手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我來壓制，你們繼續推進！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "榴彈已射出！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "工事已破壞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "壞傢伙倒了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "還有三個，正前方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "兩個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "已淨空！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "已淨空！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "已淨空！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "已淨空！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "有人受傷嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "好，我們繼續前進。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Frost，注意警戒後方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "收到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我來開門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "Blitz，警戒。Tachanka，用無人機看一下走廊和儲藏室的情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "已經在做了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "前面怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "儲藏室裡堆滿了彈藥補給，他們在這裡駐紮了有一段時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "材料室裡沒有敵人，只有幾個在培養皿中的黑色結晶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "有威脅嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "不好判斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這些罐子裡是什麼東西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "發光的礦物晶體，以前沒見過這種東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "礦石，合成物，只要它在發光，就可能有放射性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "別擔心，蓋革計數器沒有反應。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "那就直接穿過去，先不管這些石頭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "各位，沒時間可以浪費了，行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "text": "Ash，這裡是Iana。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "text": "我們剛剛解決了敵人，但是他們用大量障礙物堵住了走廊通道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "text": "我們要換一條路向核心區靠攏，完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我們正在準備進入主實驗室，請儘快支援，完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "text": "收到，Iana通訊完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "怎麼辦，需要等一等她們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不，時間緊急，不宜拖延，繼續前進。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "前面就是主實驗室大門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "準備好，我們直接進去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "注意警戒，看到目標優先制服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "別駐足太久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這裡沒有人，只有這些奇怪的機器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "別放鬆警惕，這裡的實驗器材還在運作，說明目標人物還在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "那我們得先真正進入到實驗室裡才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這裡是實驗室內的控制室，看到玻璃那邊的器械了嗎？那兒才是真正進行實驗的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "當心......這裡的敵人數量還不明朗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "不受歡迎的朋友們總是不請自來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "（發現目標，先別開槍。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "（報告周圍情況。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "（沒發現其他人。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "（沒有看到其他敵人。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "把手舉起來，列維博士，離開終端機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "我還在想你們要多久才會出現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "你們幹掉了我的保安？真是太遺憾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "我昨天才給他們結了薪水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "不過煩請各位輕拿輕放，這裡的易碎品很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不要輕舉妄動，這場鬧劇結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "結束了？我的新實驗才剛剛開始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "停下你的當前動作......我不會警告第二次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，如果我拒絕呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
