    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "哈——呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "哇哦，剛才可真險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這裡真的還是地球嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我是指，我們熟悉的那個星球？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "沒理由覺得不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "但我們要做好最壞的準備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "牆徹底塌了，這裡已經連掩體都算不上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "轉移吧，直到我們找到能落腳的地方。",
